WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.170
- Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:03.530
Obviously my little girl
came to visit me onset,

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:05.600
well, 'cause the set's in our home.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.490
This next guy though, I'm about to dial in

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.840
is a real Texas gentleman.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.567
You've enjoyed him on
the "Blue Comedy Tour,"

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:14.240
"Dancing With the Stars"
and the "Bill Engvall Show."

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.470
These days you can check
him out on Facebook Live,

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.860
and in "Last Man Standing."

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.310
Are you there, Bill?

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.740
- Oh, hey, Kell.

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.140
- Hi, my little girl
literally just came in.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.330
I don't know if you were napping,

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.680
but she came in for a little.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.450
She was like, "Who are you talking to?"

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.520
This is Bill, this is River.
- Hi.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.500
- River, you don't know me, River.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.820
Wait a minute, wait a minute.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.817
Hey River, do me a favor and smile.

00:00:36.817 --> 00:00:38.189
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:38.189 --> 00:00:39.290
Well, you know what?

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.130
You need to call the police. (laughs)

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:44.099
'Cause someone has stole
some of your teeth.

00:00:44.099 --> 00:00:45.967
- (laughing) They stole 'em!

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:48.210
She's just like Mama.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.900
I lost my two front teeth the same time.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.208
Alright, I'm gonna do
this interview, alright?

00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.460
- Okay, bye.
- I love you.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.010
- Nice meeting you, River.

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:55.060
- Her birthday is Friday.

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.717
She's very excited.

00:00:56.717 --> 00:00:57.966
- How are you, Kell?

00:00:57.966 --> 00:00:58.799
- I'm good!

00:00:58.799 --> 00:00:59.780
How are you doing?

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.990
- Well, I just want you to know,
that you're the only person

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:05.034
that I will shower in the
middle of the day for.

00:01:05.034 --> 00:01:06.790
- (laughs) I gotta be honest with you.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.976
I don't even know if that
person exists for me.

00:01:08.976 --> 00:01:09.828
(both laughing)

